+# Selected source excerpts
+
+These selected government-record excerpts preserve extracted wording, including errors and uncertainty. They are not native email/audio originals. Source-file hashes are in SOURCES.json; exact offsets and page-text hashes are in EXCERPTS.json. Manual image transcriptions are explicitly labeled.
